WEBVTT

00:06:28.672 --> 00:06:33.616
all those, if you would like, factors
of really building the future

00:06:33.873 --> 00:06:38.053
from education to research 
to entrepreneurship and commercialization.

00:06:38.622 --> 00:06:40.531
Dr Hasnah, you are an educator,

00:06:40.531 --> 00:06:42.958
and, as we are having the conversation,

00:06:42.958 --> 00:06:47.028
we are about six months 
into the COVID-19 pandemic,

00:06:47.246 --> 00:06:49.396
which has had a big impact on education -

00:06:49.396 --> 00:06:51.496
everything from closing schools

00:06:51.496 --> 00:06:54.076
to didactic plans 
that have been sidetracked,

00:06:54.076 --> 00:06:57.180
teachers that have been challenged, 
families have been challenged

00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:00.230
when students are at home, 
et cetera, et cetera.